    {
      "subId": "2300406",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Gulabgir's pet snake food",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230040601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230040601": {
            "id": "230040601",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Yes, these would do! Thank you so much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040602"
            ]
          },
          "230040602": {
            "id": "230040602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why weren't these in the camp, but on the nearby tree?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040603"
            ]
          },
          "230040603": {
            "id": "230040603",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Well... Maybe the birds had them stashed away for a rainy day...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040604"
            ]
          },
          "230040604": {
            "id": "230040604",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Is this stuff so popular with animals? Maybe I should start a business...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040605"
            ]
          },
          "230040605": {
            "id": "230040605",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Ahem! Don't mind me. Thank you very much. Here's your payment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300407",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the camp",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230040701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230040701": {
            "id": "230040701",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Yes! That's it! So I did leave it in the camp after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040702"
            ]
          },
          "230040702": {
            "id": "230040702",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It was buried under the rocks. Your camp seems to have gotten caught in a landslide that carried your stuff far away. We spent a long while looking, actually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040703"
            ]
          },
          "230040703": {
            "id": "230040703",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Seriously? How could there be a landslide? That spot has never been in any trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040704"
            ]
          },
          "230040704": {
            "id": "230040704",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Oh! When I was camping there, I could hear strange sounds at night, and I could feel something scratching at my tent...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040705"
            ]
          },
          "230040705": {
            "id": "230040705",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "My snakes were alert and would wake me every time. But I never found anything no matter how many times I checked...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040706"
            ]
          },
          "230040706": {
            "id": "230040706",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Eh, you know what, forget about it... Thanks for your help. Here's your payment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300408",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Gulabgir's pet snake food",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230040801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230040801": {
            "id": "230040801",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Yes! That's it! So I did leave it in the camp after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040802"
            ]
          },
          "230040802": {
            "id": "230040802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the camp...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040803"
            ]
          },
          "230040803": {
            "id": "230040803",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "I see... Was it the work of wild animals...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040804"
            ]
          },
          "230040804": {
            "id": "230040804",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Now that you mention it, the food I made attracted Fungi and birds... So, attracting wild animals sounds about right...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040805"
            ]
          },
          "230040805": {
            "id": "230040805",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Guess I should really consider starting a feed-selling business...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040806"
            ]
          },
          "230040806": {
            "id": "230040806",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "If that turns out well, I could be making much more money than I do now by putting up performances...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040807"
            ]
          },
          "230040807": {
            "id": "230040807",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Oh, sorry, I'm getting off-topic... Thanks for your help, and please, take your payment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300409",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the camp",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230040901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230040901": {
            "id": "230040901",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Yes! That's it! So I did leave it in the camp after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040902"
            ]
          },
          "230040902": {
            "id": "230040902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why is your camp in the middle of a bunch of thorny vines!? Wouldn't you get hurt sleeping there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040903"
            ]
          },
          "230040903": {
            "id": "230040903",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Nah, I'm pretty skilled when it comes to living in the wild.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040904"
            ]
          },
          "230040904": {
            "id": "230040904",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "And there weren't that many vines around when I established that camp.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040905"
            ]
          },
          "230040905": {
            "id": "230040905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Have you been away from the forest for a very long time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040906"
            ]
          },
          "230040906": {
            "id": "230040906",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Sort of. I can't remember the details.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040907"
            ]
          },
          "230040907": {
            "id": "230040907",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Hahaha, I'm really rusty when it comes to setting up camps now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040908"
            ]
          },
          "230040908": {
            "id": "230040908",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Most of the camps I've set up in the past have been abandoned.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040909"
            ]
          },
          "230040909": {
            "id": "230040909",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "What kind of life would I be leading had I remained in the rainforest...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230040910"
            ]
          },
          "230040910": {
            "id": "230040910",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "...Sorry, I've said too much. Here is your payment. Please take it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300410",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Gulabgir's pet snake food",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230041001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230041001": {
            "id": "230041001",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "You are back! I gotta say, that was quick. Did you find the food?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041002"
            ]
          },
          "230041002": {
            "id": "230041002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is this what you're looking for?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300411",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the camp",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230041101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230041101": {
            "id": "230041101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's special food for pet snakes? Don't they eat mice and stuff?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041102"
            ]
          },
          "230041102": {
            "id": "230041102",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Yes, they did hunt by themselves in the past.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041103"
            ]
          },
          "230041103": {
            "id": "230041103",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "But ever since they startled several children whilst feeding, I have banned them from going out without me. I've started mixing food for them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041104"
            ]
          },
          "230041104": {
            "id": "230041104",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "*sigh* But after that, they haven't been moving much, and have stubbornly refused to eat any other food.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041105"
            ]
          },
          "230041105": {
            "id": "230041105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*sigh* Paimon thought \"there was no such thing as a free lunch\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041108"
            ]
          },
          "230041108": {
            "id": "230041108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon hasn't even asked about the flavor yet, so you can dream on!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041109"
            ]
          },
          "230041109": {
            "id": "230041109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Enjoying food is Paimon's job!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041110"
            ]
          },
          "230041110": {
            "id": "230041110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Uh huh. Very reasonable of you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041111"
            ]
          },
          "230041111": {
            "id": "230041111",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "I must have left their food at one of my camps when I was out picking herbs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041112"
            ]
          },
          "230041112": {
            "id": "230041112",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "But I can't really leave, what with all my little fellas to care for and stuff. I don't want them scaring anyone again when they search for food...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230041113"
            ]
          },
          "230041113": {
            "id": "230041113",
            "speakerId": 4171,
            "speakerName": "Gulabgir",
            "text": "Traveler, would you mind visiting that campsite and fetching the food for me?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2300412",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Gulabgir's pet snake food",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
